        "Benchmark runner measures this call for timing comparison"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Verify Before Reveal",
      "items": [
        "Tag verification is a distinct security step, not implicit",
        "Invalid tag means plaintext is never released",
        "This models authenticated-encryption failure handling"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "Feeds the Dashboard",
      "items": [
        "Timing and pass/fail results are recorded per run",
        "Dashboard charts and table update from this result set",
        "Same flow repeats per algorithm for the comparison benchmark"
      ]
    }
  ]
